msgid "Language & translation"
msgstr "语言与翻译"

msgid "The spaCR Qt interface includes ten built-in languages:"
msgstr "spaCR Qt 界面内置十种语言："

msgid "English"
msgstr "英语"

msgid "Swedish (Svenska)"
msgstr "瑞典语（Svenska）"

msgid "German (Deutsch)"
msgstr "德语（Deutsch）"

msgid "Spanish (Español)"
msgstr "西班牙语（Español）"

msgid "Simplified Chinese / Mandarin (简体中文)"
msgstr "简体中文 / 普通话"

msgid "Portuguese (Português)"
msgstr "葡萄牙语（Português）"

msgid "Hindi (हिन्दी)"
msgstr "印地语（हिन्दी）"

msgid "Korean (한국어)"
msgstr "韩语（한국어）"

msgid "Icelandic (Íslenska)"
msgstr "冰岛语（Íslenska）"

msgid "French (Français)"
msgstr "法语（Français）"

msgid "Open **spaCR → Preferences…**, choose a **Language** on the General tab and press Save. Existing windows and lazily opened module screens are translated immediately. The selection is retained by ``QSettings`` for later launches."
msgstr "打开 **spaCR → 首选项…**，在 General 选项卡上选择 **语言**，然后按 Save。现有窗口和延迟打开的模块屏幕会立即翻译。所选语言由 ``QSettings`` 保存，供以后启动时使用。"

msgid "What is translated"
msgstr "翻译范围"

msgid "Language support covers the presentation layer of the Qt application:"
msgstr "语言支持涵盖 Qt 应用程序的表示层："

msgid "navigation, Preferences, common actions, tabs and section headings;"
msgstr "导航、偏好设置、常用操作、选项卡和章节标题；"

msgid "the **AI** and **Live** controls, AI-provider setup, chat placeholders, streaming status and other chat chrome;"
msgstr "**人工智能** 和 **实时** 控件、AI 服务提供方设置、聊天占位符、流式传输状态及其他聊天界面元素；"

msgid "spaCR-authored console notices such as run start, safe stop, completion, settings import and provider guidance;"
msgstr "由 spaCR 编写的控制台通知，例如运行开始、安全停止、完成、设置导入和服务提供方指引；"

msgid "reviewed one-line descriptions for all built-in modules; and"
msgstr "所有内置模块经审阅的一行说明；以及"

msgid "setting names, type hints, authored explanations, API-link captions, tooltips and accessible help text."
msgstr "设置名称、类型提示、编写的说明、API 链接文字、工具提示和无障碍帮助文本。"

msgid "Changing the language while a chat is connecting or its Send button is in Cancel mode preserves that state and any provider or path values. Only the surrounding application wording changes."
msgstr "在聊天正在连接或其 Send 按钮处于 Cancel 模式时更改语言，会保留该状态以及任何服务提供方或路径值。只有周围的应用程序措辞会改变。"

msgid "Contextual help"
msgstr "上下文帮助"

msgid "Module and setting tooltips have complete external catalog entries in every bundled language. Setting tooltips are assembled from separate semantic fields so the setting name, type, authored explanation and API caption can be checked independently. Format fields, code literals, scientific symbols, URLs and option values are immutable during catalog generation. A translation is accepted only when those structural values survive; otherwise spaCR uses the canonical English text."
msgstr "模块和设置的工具提示在每种内置语言中都有完整的外部目录条目。设置工具提示由独立的语义字段组装而成，因此可以分别检查设置名称、类型、编写的说明和 API 文字。在生成目录时，格式字段、代码字面量、科学符号、URL 和选项值都不可更改。只有这些结构性值保持不变，翻译才会被接受；否则 spaCR 使用规范的英文文本。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The **API** link at the foot of each setting's tooltip keeps the exact documentation URL in every language. Its caption and accessible name follow the selected language, and changing language refreshes already-open settings windows. Where visual help exists, the tooltip footer also offers an **Animation** word that reveals the drawing beside the text. The scientific drawing itself is language-neutral. See the :doc:`setting animation gallery <setting_animations>` for every exact mapping."
msgstr "每个设置工具提示底部的 **API** 链接在所有语言中都保留确切的文档 URL。其文字和无障碍名称跟随所选语言，更改语言会刷新已打开的设置窗口。在有可视化帮助的地方，工具提示底部还提供一个 **动画** 词，点击后会在文字旁显示图示。科学图示本身与语言无关。所有确切的映射请参阅 :doc:`设置动画库 <setting_animations>`。"

msgid "Translation safety"
msgstr "翻译安全"

msgid "Translation is presentation-only. Raw worker stdout, logs, tracebacks, filenames, paths, setting values, database contents, annotations, measurements, reports and saved results are never modified. User chat messages and AI responses also remain exactly as written or returned."
msgstr "翻译仅作用于表示层。原始的工作线程 stdout、日志、回溯、文件名、路径、设置值、数据库内容、标注、测量结果、报告和保存的结果绝不会被修改。用户的聊天消息和 AI 回复也完全按原样保留。"

msgid "The console distinguishes spaCR-authored interface notices from analytical output. Notices may be presented in the selected language, while pipeline lines and errors pass through unchanged. Template values such as a path, provider name, function name or error detail are preserved even when the surrounding notice is translated."
msgstr "控制台会区分 spaCR 编写的界面通知与分析输出。通知可以用所选语言显示，而流程输出行和错误原样通过。即使周围的通知被翻译，路径、服务提供方名称、函数名或错误详情等模板值也会被保留。"

msgid "When a scientific or third-party term has no catalog entry, spaCR displays the original English text. This explicit fallback is preferable to guessing the meaning of a technical control."
msgstr "当某个科学术语或第三方术语没有目录条目时，spaCR 显示原始英文文本。这种明确的回退比猜测技术控件的含义更可取。"

msgid "The environment variable ``SPACR_LANGUAGE`` can temporarily override the saved preference, which is useful for screenshots and automated testing:"
msgstr "环境变量 ``SPACR_LANGUAGE`` 可以临时覆盖保存的偏好，这在截图和自动化测试中很有用："

msgid "Contributing translations"
msgstr "贡献翻译"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Compact reviewed chrome remains in :mod:`spacr.qt.i18n`. The full runtime catalogs live in ``spacr/qt/i18n_catalogs``. Their setting and interface records are bound to canonical English text by source hashes; setting records use setting identifiers rather than English sentences as keys. Each language file contains the exact current key set for setting names, tooltips, category help, module summaries and extracted Qt text. Tests require every locale to be non-empty and structurally complete. New interface text always has a safe English fallback while a translation is being reviewed."
msgstr "精简且经过审查的界面文本保留在 :mod:`spacr.qt.i18n` 中。完整的运行时目录位于 ``spacr/qt/i18n_catalogs``。其中的设置和界面记录通过源文本哈希绑定到标准英文文本；设置记录以设置标识符而非英文句子作为键。每个语言文件都包含设置名称、工具提示、类别帮助、模块摘要和提取的 Qt 文本的完整当前键集合。测试要求每个语言版本非空且结构完整。在翻译接受审查期间，新界面文本始终可安全回退到英文。"

msgid "The generator in ``tools/build_i18n_catalogs.py`` protects runtime fields and applies the reviewed terminology table after translation. False friends such as *screen*, *run*, *crop*, *mask*, *flow*, *plate* and *gate* are reviewed in their software and microscopy context rather than as isolated words. Plugins can provide exact translations through their translation metadata."
msgstr "``tools/build_i18n_catalogs.py`` 中的生成器会保护运行时字段，并在翻译后应用经审阅的术语表。*screen*、*run*、*crop*、*mask*、*flow*、*plate* 和 *gate* 等易混淆词会结合软件和显微成像语境进行审阅，而不是作为孤立的词处理。插件可以通过其翻译元数据提供确切的翻译。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Review inputs and translated guides"
msgstr "审查输入和翻译指南"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Runtime and API review records are restored from the immutable revision in ``docs/translation_reviews_revision.json``. Run ``python tools/bootstrap_translation_reviews.py fetch`` to restore that revision; ``python tools/bootstrap_translation_reviews.py check`` verifies it using the existing cache without fetching. The bootstrap refuses to overwrite locally modified or unpinned review records. Review metadata identifies the recorded reviewer; AI technical review does not establish native-speaker signoff."
msgstr "运行时和 API 审查记录从 ``docs/translation_reviews_revision.json`` 中指定的不可变修订恢复。运行 ``python tools/bootstrap_translation_reviews.py fetch`` 可恢复该修订；``python tools/bootstrap_translation_reviews.py check`` 使用已有缓存进行验证，不进行抓取。引导工具拒绝覆盖本地修改过或未固定到修订的审查记录。审查元数据标明记录的审查者；AI 技术审查不代表母语使用者已认可。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Translated user guides use Sphinx gettext catalogs under ``docs/i18n/guides``. The guide-page language picker opens the corresponding language tree; API translations instead load into the current page. Guide paragraphs without a current, non-fuzzy translation remain in English. ``tools/build_guide_i18n.py`` extracts English templates, updates catalogs, exports and imports translation worklists, and audits translations and review labels. These guide catalogs are separate from the runtime and API catalogs."
msgstr "翻译的用户指南使用 ``docs/i18n/guides`` 下的 Sphinx gettext 目录。指南页面的语言选择器打开对应语言的页面树；API 翻译则加载到当前页面中。没有当前有效且非 fuzzy 翻译的指南段落保留英文。``tools/build_guide_i18n.py`` 提取英文模板、更新目录、导出和导入翻译工作列表，并审计翻译和审查标签。这些指南目录与运行时和 API 目录分开维护。"

msgid "API documentation and the project page"
msgstr "API 文档与项目页面"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "English docstrings remain beside their Python functions. Translated API text is stored separately under ``docs/source/_static/i18n/api`` and keyed by the fully qualified Python symbol plus a SHA-256 hash of the English source. The documentation language picker loads these files on demand and checks them against the English catalog. A failed load or freshness check restores the English view. API language selection uses the page's ``lang`` query, a saved browser choice, then a supported browser language; it is separate from the Qt application's saved language. A changed English docstring also makes the corresponding translation fail the freshness audit."
msgstr "英文文档字符串保留在相应 Python 函数旁。翻译的 API 文本单独存储在 ``docs/source/_static/i18n/api`` 下，以完全限定的 Python 符号和英文源文本的 SHA-256 哈希作为键。文档语言选择器按需加载这些文件，并将其与英文目录核对。加载或新鲜度检查失败时，会恢复英文视图。API 语言依次由页面的 ``lang`` 查询参数、浏览器中保存的选择、受支持的浏览器语言确定；它与 Qt 应用保存的语言相互独立。英文文档字符串更改后，对应翻译也会无法通过新鲜度审计。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "For a local API documentation build, ``python tools/build_documentation_i18n.py --assemble`` restores the separately pinned ``api_memory`` catalogs from ``docs/media_revision.json``, applies the source-bound review records and writes the English manifest. This assembles existing translation memory without running a translation model."
msgstr "构建本地 API 文档时，``python tools/build_documentation_i18n.py --assemble`` 从 ``docs/media_revision.json`` 恢复单独固定版本的 ``api_memory`` 目录，应用绑定到源文本的审查记录，并写入英文清单。这会组装已有的翻译记忆库，而不运行翻译模型。"

msgid "Translated GitHub project pages live under ``docs/i18n/readme``. Their code, commands, URLs, badges and language navigation are preserved exactly, while the explanatory prose is localized. Model and license attribution is recorded in ``docs/i18n/TRANSLATION_MODELS.md``."
msgstr "翻译后的 GitHub 项目页面位于 ``docs/i18n/readme`` 下。其中的代码、命令、URL、徽章和语言导航完全保留，而说明性文字则经过本地化。模型和许可证的归属记录在 ``docs/i18n/TRANSLATION_MODELS.md`` 中。"

msgid "Installers"
msgstr "安装程序"

msgid "The Windows, macOS and Linux online installers share the ten locale resources in ``packaging/i18n``. They select the operating system's UI language and fall back to English; ``SPACR_INSTALL_LANGUAGE`` provides an explicit override. Shell, PowerShell and NSIS resources are generated by ``packaging/i18n/render.py`` so translated messages never become duplicated inside platform control flow."
msgstr "Windows、macOS 和 Linux 在线安装程序共享 ``packaging/i18n`` 中的十种语言资源。它们选择操作系统的界面语言，并回退到英语；``SPACR_INSTALL_LANGUAGE`` 提供显式覆盖。Shell、PowerShell 和 NSIS 资源由 ``packaging/i18n/render.py`` 生成，因此翻译后的消息绝不会在各平台的控制流程中重复出现。"

msgid "Developers should send raw pipeline output through ``append_stdout`` or ``append_error`` and use ``append_notice`` only for a stable, spaCR-authored UI template. Dynamic application chrome uses a stable source template so runtime language changes cannot translate an earlier translation or overwrite a live path/result label. Catalog tests enforce translation width and format-field parity, and language tests assert that output and chat content remain unchanged."
msgstr "开发者应通过 ``append_stdout`` 或 ``append_error`` 发送原始流程输出，并且仅对稳定的、由 spaCR 编写的界面模板使用 ``append_notice``。动态的应用程序界面使用稳定的源模板，因此运行时更改语言不会翻译已经翻译过的文本，也不会覆盖正在显示的路径/结果标签。目录测试会强制检查翻译宽度和格式字段一致性，语言测试则断言输出和聊天内容保持不变。"

msgid "Related API"
msgstr "相关 API"

