msgstr ":mod:`spacr.qt.i18n` — 语言目录和运行时控件的重新翻译。"

msgid ":mod:`spacr.qt.preferences` — persisted language selection and Preferences."
msgstr ":mod:`spacr.qt.preferences` — 持久化的语言选择和偏好设置。"

msgid ":mod:`spacr.qt.i18n_module_summaries` — built-in module help lookup."
msgstr ":mod:`spacr.qt.i18n_module_summaries` — 内置模块帮助查询。"

msgid ":mod:`spacr.qt.screens.settings_model` — semantic setting tooltips and API links."
msgstr ":mod:`spacr.qt.screens.settings_model` — 语义化的设置工具提示和 API 链接。"

msgid ":mod:`spacr.setting_animations` — exact setting-to-animation registry."
msgstr ":mod:`spacr.setting_animations` — 确切的设置到动画的注册表。"

msgid ":class:`spacr.qt.widgets.console_panel.ConsolePanel` — separate raw-output and localized-notice paths."
msgstr ":class:`spacr.qt.widgets.console_panel.ConsolePanel` — 相互独立的原始输出路径和本地化通知路径。"

